  m_text: '1. Scan the floor until a plane is detected.


    2. Select a furniture
    item.


    3. Tap the floor to place it.


    4. Tap furniture to select it.
    Drag to move, pinch to resize, twist to rotate.


    5. Use Color to recolor
    it, or Delete to remove it.


    6. Press Reset to clear all furniture.'
